---

## Memory Trick

Think:

```
CASE = IF
WHEN = condition
THEN = output
ELSE = otherwise
END = finish
```

Example:

```
IF salary > 50000
THEN 'High'
ELSE 'Low'
```

SQL:

```sql
CASE
WHEN salary > 50000 THEN 'High'
ELSE 'Low'
END
```

